<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

  <title>Delete Account | CoinMine PK</title>
  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Request deletion of your CoinMine PK account and associated data."
  />

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet"
  />

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-dark: #07140f;
      --bg-mid: #0b2a1d;
      --bg-green: #0f6a43;
      --card: rgba(10, 28, 21, 0.82);
      --primary: #32d583;
      --secondary: #13b76a;
      --gold: #f5c451;
      --text: #ffffff;
      --muted: #cbe9da;
      --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 15%, rgba(50, 213, 131, 0.22), transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 85%, rgba(245, 196, 81, 0.14), transparent 28%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-dark), var(--bg-mid), var(--bg-green));
    }

    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 880px;
    }

    .card {
      padding: 48px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 28px;
      background: var(--card);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      box-shadow: 0 28px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    }

    .brand {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 34px;
    }

    .logo {
      width: 92px;
      height: 92px;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 24px;
      font-size: 42px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
      box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(50, 213, 131, 0.3);
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 40px);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .section {
      margin-top: 26px;
      padding: 24px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    }

    .section h2 {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: #7cf0b1;
      font-size: 21px;
    }

    .section p {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.8;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    ul {
      margin-top: 14px;
      padding-left: 22px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    li {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .email-button {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 15px 24px;
      border-radius: 13px;
      color: #06120c;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), #ffd978);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(245, 196, 81, 0.25);
      transition: 0.2s ease;
    }

    .email-button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .notice {
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding: 22px;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--gold);
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(245, 196, 81, 0.08);
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 34px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #b8d8c8;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      body {
        padding: 20px 14px;
      }

      .card {
        padding: 30px 22px;
      }

      .email-button {
        width: 100%;
        text-align: center;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="wrapper">
    <section class="card">

      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">⛏️</div>

        <h1>Delete Your CoinMine PK Account</h1>

        <p class="subtitle">
          Your privacy matters to us. You can request permanent deletion of
          your CoinMine PK account and associated data at any time.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <h2>📧 Request Account Deletion</h2>

        <p>
          To request permanent deletion of your CoinMine PK account, send an
          email from the email address registered with your account.
        </p>

        <p style="margin-top:12px;">
          Use the subject:
          <strong>“Delete My CoinMine PK Account”</strong>
        </p>

        <a
          class="email-button"
          href="mailto:usamasaeedtts11@gmail.com?subject=Delete%20My%20CoinMine%20PK%20Account&body=Hello%2C%0A%0AI%20would%20like%20to%20permanently%20delete%20my%20CoinMine%20PK%20account%20and%20associated%20data.%0A%0ARegistered%20email%3A%20%0AUsername%3A%20%0A%0AThank%20you."
        >
          ✉️ Send Deletion Request
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <h2>🗑️ Data That Will Be Deleted</h2>

        <ul>
          <li>Account and login information</li>
          <li>Profile information</li>
          <li>Coin balance</li>
          <li>Energy balance and mining activity</li>
          <li>Survey activity and completion history</li>
          <li>Rewarded ad activity</li>
          <li>Withdrawal requests and related account activity</li>
          <li>Other account-related records associated with your profile</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <h2>⏳ Processing Time</h2>

        <p>
          Account deletion requests are normally processed within
          <strong>7 business days</strong> after the request is received and
          verified.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="notice">
        <strong>Important:</strong><br><br>
        Once your account is permanently deleted, your remaining Coin and
        Energy balances, activity history, and other associated account data
        cannot be recovered. Certain limited records may be retained where
        required by applicable law, security requirements, fraud prevention,
        or dispute resolution.
      </div>

      <footer>
        © 2026 CoinMine PK. All rights reserved.
      </footer>

    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
